  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:805bd67fa3b06e6a4db8f7c3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "成为殿堂赛马娘前在<single_battle_record>留有成绩，实力堪称一级。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61b6dc680367bb8b7ca2de5405e8abcc5984eb41e1949d725144a912a5fe5ff4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85a2758e192609f88447cdae",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不过，是速度颇受好评，备受期待的新人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1ecdb6105cd4acefb8e9728eea228b9ec1a13d0463dc2d58ab6afb5afa743f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6b459e53b49031d42f26559",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不过，是耐力颇受好评，备受期待的新人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1c09c124a0edadac10ac5f86c15f41987b51b085f1010d421093832e660eabd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bfdbb7921e24fc32e4e5645",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不过，是力量颇受好评，备受期待的新人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7836231f38cb7e7f546bc65606d163d95b9f73bae2036e4b2792861b9b6f71a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e049fcfd4d04672b0aa7345",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不过，是根性颇受好评，备受期待的新人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63affc6c6aa1ecc3cbb2a7d8d93e13429fd6f56d512a8b7c63c7ddbda6de1a44",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60c87c10485065da5d88e6a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不过，是智力颇受好评，备受期待的新人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da292a82be23d15f5546c141713344a330cf11fbc7e550ef7bfc8689fa28272d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f375896de1fde28524a34291",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不过，是领放战术颇受好评，备受期待的新人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92ab363b8d022832858cda1f9f887e5348975646219e5ea360a6d9f0e97d4498",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:833029bae7b85d34cc53ae26",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不过，是先行战术颇受好评，备受期待的新人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "334b1aaae3b960a2ba77134468b77e2ea14cdfe6b041ed79a9459f27990cbe0a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:febdbf9a4c639d6a23c006c9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不过，是居中战术颇受好评，备受期待的新人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e640ce330a8ec89e2da4423d1bbc807331fb91997554d425dc0df9657b9c24ab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21a2d6a1e478f264f65207fd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "情势变得有利后所展现出那精彩的表现让人目不转睛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "013fb77ed981a8093cc7665247e922f408a9aa0b7594344946a8efc8b2be0450",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "2100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f10c943676c48b8bd22399d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正因为体验过胜利和败北，她的实力才值得期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4cc9f966a26e43324a2cf09c394aa9a91f87d966f011d4e0d87dc127cf669f7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "2101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b76464799d213398841af5f5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "看来也越来越适应<race_course>的<race_distance>了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e79fd358c5f76195c9fbc3dcdc91e27d9fa3c5a5af49bf395ee7917de5daaccb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "2102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52c50f895ab63ad7f0b2b905",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不过，是追赶战术颇受好评，备受期待的新人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "796796cc36673153bb912ed0d74f0f02043991c9c1f5127a59f7bb247ec22066",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ac7f005c91ef17b0bbb5923",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是这场竞赛中必须关注的1人……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "067582d58c57a43b238ccf428467b5657668953e9a0c0a5281f651e7816d944a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "2200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd3312c32c74178b397da685",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是否还能增添更多胜场数呢，令人期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d39f766c9330ee0d79721b3a065d69d28a18a49825c65296b89bf16a74ac727",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "2201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f2b3e3b77b1a8151f505421",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "第2场胜利已经触手可及，出赛吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca5bfa3adf17549106ba6f605308c35c72bab5c194daf6c4c483d9c59616a653",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "2202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1883c1f74db37f1bacd1f7aa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这次也能用擅长的领放战术掌握胜利吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d6b51ea5fcdae1e69e842768c5ef6f5bb7bcd726262432c987aebc36c2d9ea4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "2203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44637e59c438cc68a14c1555",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这次也能用擅长的先行战术掌握胜利吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "84e56fa9c57e27c33d90a2da6eb351da6f23a29c5ccedf547a71ba27c12cb10b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "2204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30af3e56ee40655fefe24261",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这次也能用擅长的居中战术掌握胜利吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b51f0cc810ecf9abf3f4bbda04be4e3e87fbcc9ed50b31b25ae7e78565d653a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "2205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8019559da999023dd192fca5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这次也能用擅长的追赶战术掌握胜利吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "99e68a996c53e0ac147dcbf19aa6c938ea909ce591836182414e2087e94276ba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "2206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73368fa511699143b25f50db",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有预感本次大赛将刮起旋风……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd06814c2a96e954fafe6a3aa5aecc1ffe0cfe26d35dec37d43057988e883bc9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "300"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d783f80cec6289bb589bfce3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "目前胜率33%，是瞩目的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4db76fa07349cf9d5977b210348320702d53876476deaf8bee3540a75797fbe5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "3000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02f0456940ed14be418b1c70",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "3战1胜，值得瞩目的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d508e754c2e9e14e56ed1eeab094cd1129df9a08e96d58ae79803b538246bf58",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "3001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f97417d1ccef7187b61cdfb8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "目标是第2场胜利，实力坚强的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecfb84a406f17e03675abf3d771ad3bc139c61fc880b3c0e4f174c5a1cc7ccab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "3002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e44671feb2167a0ead7638e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终于能在这场大赛发挥本领……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dee360f99328fbd0d28022e692dec3c0e85227114d5a8ddf24cdadc63136ef8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "301"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d343d65a8bb3cf4acaa91f1b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能够刮起狂风吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b741eb74ea6945907d6e0208eb8d3155019b20bce4cc4149c29e62e93343fc2a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "302"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b4e4d79524524f030042593",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "迈向荣耀之道就此开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1d963bd9d627791369efed4d9a272877769221078c994fd16b6f9d5303f9c85",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "303"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31b4f7005e221bd38bf7c6e7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其强而有力的跑姿，让对手也另眼相看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2eab0f1d20f7bc6d1e08e8e5a0671593b2a4023213905ad54c67612fcef834cf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "3100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70d0ccb9acbfffb5b6d9438f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "作为炒热这次大赛气氛的其中1人，实力毫无疑问。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2dd55aed75e91e2230dbaa3a272be7342142c738405e51b10ee6f1c6ecf04c9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "3101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e1a1d12601f2472fe20a5db",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "心无旁鹜的准备，所展现的状态值得期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3092dbae73f198908b47c1732c26f78071051674ee5976354164b7d083e8599b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "3102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:245e74b1fb78b0af2359a864",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不光是实力，还能期待用广受好评的领放跑姿迷倒粉丝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16a73a674bcb783783daa2eff075feed4fa462fa5c171f0775fb565b7005c5f4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "3103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cf494c3cce03a1e90808dfa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不光是实力，还能期待用广受好评的先行跑姿迷倒粉丝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c7e9f1fd0dd32de490d2ca9197a16303a931526fbed9df961b75063726a572e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "3104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f260c298ee3ad06150f9c2bb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不光是实力，还能期待用广受好评的居中跑姿迷倒粉丝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "277ad7e97b06d18b9da2adce891bc437a6e518d0227a1f88c15d25dfecda69d8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "3105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8ee6ec6b394bd58a3abfd00",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不光是实力，还能期待用广受好评的追赶跑姿迷倒粉丝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfecb745ce8d355345f37d0498b27624dc6b78035a68134a11bfd44b300f0abe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "3106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24acf0cd6ee7f88b1f83de2f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能成为引领本次竞赛的存在吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95f2acf7c558dc9da0430785b7cbe9b9abfb3b3026557cabd6d9e3dfd17eb72b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "3200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e59101ad9dc7b1afc3e430e9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在这场比赛也能拿下胜利吗……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "edfc87b9aa30e14e692568a7c7d56340a582459c6eff5fd2dcb8fd7499458e43",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "3201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:801bfe8035767cbdf932065b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以第1名的成绩跑完<race_course>的<race_distance>吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44e152d3cc0d351b0c5ff1c66e6eddffba7aba39e12d97dce5d159bb92bfa8f2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "3202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4423efba1353618ee54ba5b7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "目前胜率50%，是必须关注的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea4c79a275d44f3172127b1e00b2aa21e030d0cedab3c71c4e5289d8d4a878dc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "4000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:343cd8fe2e4bca5c1478c099",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "知道如何取胜，是必须关注的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f346ce5273828cde1b58323369920fe4ce1c7f116766494018ad2dcb03b35340",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "4001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:280958d3810fb2f11c823ad5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无法不给予期待的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17db342647b966fdd215df312c5f47885a14bcb262533bdc767a5b77809f6283",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "4002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:710ca9a1eedbbe5b38af6365",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "经常散发着带有胜利气息的存在感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bf10a28b209846e1060bdaadcd4563c7e2adc61a80d3e57ff27d349d4adf117",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "4100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c45e79aa0884be54594a855f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "响应全国粉丝的热情视线，确实跑出成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f86c05c5fac29e4ef37658c850cfa37ff986b3258d900600c0ec03fa3909bae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "4101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aeda3eebec0555f7c829abd6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从成绩来看，<race_distance>对她来说是易如反掌吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fba60fab71722e668f7ba15dea674f29cd759a7dda12a9fc4fe357bbbaea7d6d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "4102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c312587eeecb8927bdc18484",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "还能展现出精彩的表现吗……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4e2ae3bb333856cbfe7e6ea72f4bcd2ed8483640918c7fef0ab9b7384a5fc35",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "4200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6f7f99548fcea6748f72f61",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这次也会展现足以在关键时刻取胜的表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eeddc054144884d56c6fdd2f0becc095579c86b8ef935ce10919ac6074604bac",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "4201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6de09e1489a76d119547188",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "也期待着在本次大赛中展现的闪亮未来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6c9fcbaae74dd1c2aca30e5f581eb6fb7f18d7ca944759f7eb40cd7f4317a5b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "4202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63144c11327c4307a49fbb87",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "目前3战2胜，总之是兼具强度与速度的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ebe3c665eeb2124baf16d9ceafcb451080c0091ae8eeaccc6b337aa971b1e79",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
